  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>ABOUT THE GAME</b>

    RageBait Yourself is a first-person challenge
    game about movement, misdirection, and the small decisions that turn easy into
    one more try.


    Six levels move from a dark forest maze and obstacle course
    to platforming, relic hunting, an escape room, and a target finale. The world
    is built to look tempting, readable, and just a little untrustworthy.


    <b>ABOUT
    THE DEVELOPER</b>

    Created by <b>Anupam Kanoongo</b>. This is a personal
    game project built from a love of atmospheric environments, playful traps, and
    games that make failure feel like part of the story.


    Thanks for playing.
    If a path looks too safe, it probably has a punchline.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d34fc572860704dda944af047e86a6ea, type: 2}
